  "notes": [
    "P2-08 (meteor impacts). Examples: the Errington and Vermilion Zn-Cu-Pb deposits in the crater fill of the Sudbury structure (Ames, Watkinson & Parrish 1998, Geology 26:447-450), the sulphide and carbonate veins of Haughton and the Ries (Osinski et al. 2013, Icarus 224:347-363); Grieve & Masaitis 1994 (The economic potential of terrestrial impact craters, Int. Geol. Rev. 36(2):105-151).",
    "PLACEHOLDERS (design values, no USGS grade-tonnage or deposit-density model exists for impact deposits; crates/deeptime-core/data/usgs/impact_structures.json): tonnage, grades, ore density, deposit density, separation, clustering, geometry and the curves' thresholds.",
